# Cross-compiled binaries — regenerate with `cd go && sh build.sh`.
# Never committed: a binary in the tree invites people to run bytes nobody
# can diff, which is the opposite of what this repository is for.
go/dist/

# Python bytecode from the reference implementation.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The bare module-name binary `go build` drops in go/ — same rule as dist/.
go/subnsubmonitor

# The relay, built the way its README tells you to. Same rule again.
relay/subnsub-monitor-relay
relay/subnsubmonitorrelay

# A relay's saved state: the names someone typed and the last reading from
# each of their machines. Never something to commit.
relay/state.json
relay/state.json.tmp
